config AVM_ENABLE_MMRT_NIFS
    bool "Enable MMRT (int8/int4 vector kernel) NIFs"
    default y
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3 || IDF_TARGET_ESP32P4
    help
        matvec/matmul on the chip's vector unit: the ESP32-S3's PIE, or the ESP32-P4's (row
        dot products), with an exact C path for anything they can't take.
